WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:13.840
I've chased down every question

2
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.220
Read the books and followed every thread

3
00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:32.040
But standing at the edge of all I know

4
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:41.360
I feel a deeper hunger in me

5
00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.740
There's a thirst that won't be satisfied

6
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.480
By everything the world has shown

7
00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:58.860
We gather pearls of wisdom as we go

8
00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:05.440
But the deepest truths remain unknown

9
00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:13.000
We learn from what our senses tell us

10
00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:18.200
We trust the ones who came before

11
00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:25.360
We reason through the darkness for a light

12
00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:34.260
But something's calling out for more

13
00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:45.120
Human minds have built cathedrals

14
00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.520
Mapped the stars and split the atom wide

15
00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.900
But when I ask "Why am I here?"

16
00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.240
The world has never satisfied

17
00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:15.280
Ever learning, never landing

18
00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:19.300
On the ground where certainty begins

19
00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:25.780
I've found the limits of my reach —

20
00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:37.920
Now I'm ready to look within

21
00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:42.500
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

22
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:49.960
Walking toward the light that never dims

23
00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.680
What the mind begins to question

24
00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:02.460
The spirit can complete

25
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.960
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

26
00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:25.040
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

27
00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:33.460
How did all of this begin?

28
00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:40.700
Is there purpose in the change?

29
00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:45.960
Is someone guiding, watching, reaching down

30
00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.380
To meet me where I am?

31
00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:57.620
I won't cling to fear of answers

32
00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:08.440
I won't hide behind my doubt

33
00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:16.740
Great wisdom leads to peace, I'm told

34
00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:26.480
And I'm ready to find out

35
00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:29.360
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

36
00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:38.740
Walking toward the light that never dims

37
00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:43.700
What the mind begins to question

38
00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:49.540
The spirit can complete

39
00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:01.260
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

40
00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:12.540
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

41
00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:20.400
I am more than flesh and reasoning

42
00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.120
There's a spirit living here inside

43
00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:36.800
When I reached beyond what I could prove

44
00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:45.700
That's when God became real to me

45
00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:52.140
The questions didn't disappear

46
00:05:54.040 --> 00:06:00.140
But fear gave way to hope

47
00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:28.360
In the stillness something spoke to me:

48
00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.000
"You were never searching alone"

49
00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:36.480
This is when God becomes real —

50
00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:38.520
Not a theory, but a voice you feel

51
00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.720
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

52
00:06:52.720 --> 00:07:02.460
Walking toward the light that never dims

53
00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.140
What the mind begins to question

54
00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.940
The spirit can complete

55
00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:24.620
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

56
00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:38.480
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

57
00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:44.280
So if you're standing where I stood

58
00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.440
Hungry, searching, wondering if it's real

59
00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:55.640
Ask Him — just speak what's in your heart

60
00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.240
He has answered me

61
00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.240
He will answer you

62
00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.240
Truth is knowable

63
00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.240
Peace can be found

64
00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.240
This I promise

65
00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.240
In the name of Jesus Christ

66
00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.240
Amen.
